<title>SWEDEN: SWEDEN'S RIKSBANK BUYS CROWNS VS MARK - DEALERS.</title>
<headline>SWEDEN'S RIKSBANK BUYS CROWNS VS MARK - DEALERS.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Riksbank intervened in the market on Thursday with dealers saying the central bank bought crowns for marks at around 4.3120 to the mark.</p>
<p>This was the second time this week that the Riksbank was said to have intervened in the market, buying crowns against the mark, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1110 GMT the crown was trading at 4.3050 to the mark compared to 4.3025 at 0910 and 4.2895 at 0715 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
</text>
